I recently switched from the proprietary driver to the nouveau driver
and everything appeared to go well except that during boot I see:
GPU lockup detected switching to software fbcon
so I did some googling and ended up adding 'nouveau.noaccel=3D1' to my
command line which solves the issue. Obviously this isn't ideal as I'd
like to have accel turned on ;)

Does anyone have any idea why I'm getting the lockup?

